'''Yabaâna''' (also '''Yabaána''' or '''Yabahana''') is an [[Extinct language|extinct or dormant]] [[List of Indigenous peoples of South America|South American Indigenous]] [[Indigenous languages of South America|language]] in [[Brazil]], of the [[Arawakan languages|Arawakan (Maipurean) language family]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Yabaâna |url=https://www.ethnologue.com/language/ybn/ |access-date=2025-01-01 |website=Ethnologue}}</ref>

